OMP Bot Android companion (android/)

The Android application in this directory (android/) is part of omp-bot,
Copyright 2026 omp-bot contributors, and is distributed under the MIT License
(see the repository root LICENSE).

It contains code derived from the OpenMausBot Android companion application
at the release snapshot identified above: the SSE line parser and event stream,
the pairing-link address rules, the Keystore-backed device-token store, the
25-second background connection grace window and its anchor service, the opt-in
always-on foreground service, the notification-channel and PendingIntent
conventions, and the QR scanner (CameraX + bundled ML Kit). The per-file
mapping and the list of deliberately omitted upstream features are recorded in
android/PROVENANCE.md.

Bundle dependencies and their licenses are recorded in android/PROVENANCE.md,
including ML Kit barcode-scanning, which is distributed under the ML Kit Terms
of Service rather than an open-source license.
